OL,3,GNEWSA'Surreal' for singer to hear song
OL,4,Aon Celebrity Traitors
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I love murder mystery and binge
OL,7,Fwatched with my partner and I'm
OL,8,Fabsolutely hooked, I love it!"
OL,10,FThe new series of Celebrity Traitors
OL,11,Fhas had its fair share of dramatic
OL,12,Fmoments and shock reveals, but its
OL,13,Fsoundtrack has done much to create the
OL,14,Fmoody atmosphere, with its brooding
OL,15,Fcovers and cinematic compositions.
OL,17,FDorset singer-songwriter Lloren, real
OL,18,Fname Lauren Bannon, has had three of
OL,19,Fher songs featured during some of
OL,20,Fseries two's most explosive moments.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
