OL,4,Aon Celebrity Traitors
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was only this series that I was
OL,7,Flike 'do you know what, I need to watch
OL,8,Fthis' because... I thought this, this
OL,9,Fsounds like a bit of me," she said in
OL,10,Fthe countdown to the show's explosive
OL,11,Ffinale.
